    <div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre> echo passthru("cat $greet 2&gt;&amp;1", $err);
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div>    </div>
    <p>is how we are gonna get the flag. The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">$greet</code> variable, which we can control, will be passed into <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">passthru</code> function; which will then be executed as a shell command.</p>
